[NAME]
gm \- schedules GantMagic projects and generates reports

[ENVIRONMENT]

.TP
\fBGANTMAGIC_DATA_PATH\fR
Override the path to the GantMagic data folder.
The data folder contains the css, icons and scripts
for GantMagic reports.

.TP
\fBTZ\fR
The POSIX Time Zone environment variable.

Any environment variable may be used in a GantMagic file using the expression $(VAR_NAME).

[EXAMPLES]

gm tutorial.tjp

[SEE ALSO]
gmclient(1), gmd(1), gmman(1), gmss_receiver(1), gmss_sender(1), gmts_receiver(1), gmts_sender(1), gmts_summary(1), gmwebd(1)

The full GantMagic manual is available online at https://example.com/gantmagic/manual/, or via the gmman command.
